This licence covers the LiDSeg framework itself: models/lidseg.py,
models/dehazeformer.py, models/lgf.py, models/loss.py, and the train/, configs/,
scripts/, evaluation/, tools/, latency/ and tests/ directories, together with
dataset/loader.py and dataset/segdatasets/acdc.py.

It does NOT cover the following, which are derivative works of other projects
and remain under their own licences:

  * models/segmodels/ -- ports of third-party segmentation backbones.
  * dataset/transforms/transforms.py, dataset/segdatasets/base_dataset.py,
    dataset/segdatasets/cityscapes.py and dataset/segdatasets/utils.py --
    derived from panoptic-deeplab and tensorflow/models (Apache-2.0).


No datasets and no pretrained weights are distributed with this repository.
Each is governed by the licence of its original provider; see the "Datasets"
section of README.md.
